id: pm-2firut
title: "GH-1051: package catalog rejects universal output-budget controls"
description: "GitHub issue #1051 reports that the read-only package --catalog mode is rejected when a generic caller supplies the universal output-budget recovery controls, even though the catalog is a complete read surface. Make command intent mode-sensitive so catalog accepts bounded/unbounded read controls while mutating package modes remain protected and discoverable through CLI/SDK contracts."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:cli","area:sdk","github:1051",output-contract
