updated_at: "2026-08-17T13:09:39.009Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-17T13:09:02.654Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-17T13:09:02.654Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-5t33or
resolution: "CLI and SDK package catalog contracts accept output budget, limit, format, include, session, cursor, and row controls only in catalog mode."
expected_result: Generic bounded-read callers can invoke package catalog without command-contract rejection.
actual_result: Catalog accepts universal read controls through CLI and SDK; catalog-plus-mutation combinations still fail closed.
